t,\n   159→          OutreachMessage, Contact ORM\n   160→      - id: data-agent.models.auth\n   161→        scope: backend/models/auth.py — MagicLinkToken, Session ORM\n   162→      - id: data-agent.schemas.discovery\n   163→        scope: backend/agents/discovery/schemas.py — Pydantic v2 schemas for all\n   164→          discovery contracts\n   165→      - id: data-agent.schemas.application\n   166→        scope: backend/agents/application/schemas.py — Pydantic v2 schemas for\n   167→          application contracts\n   168→  - id: design-agent\n   169→    scope: Design tokens, Top Shelf editorial, CSS custom properties, typography,\n   170→      StatusBadge, StatCard\n   171→    branch: feat/design-agent\n   172→    blocked_by: []\n   173→    blocks:\n   174→      - frontend-agent\n   175→    capabilities:\n   176→      - tailwind\n   177→      - css-tokens\n   178→      - design-system\n   179→    sub_agents:\n   180→      - id: design-agent.tokens.palette\n   181→        scope: frontend/src/design/tokens.css — Top Shelf palette as CSS custom\n   182→          properties (--ink, --paper, --gold, severity colors)\n   183→      - id: design-agent.tokens.typography\n   184→        scope: frontend/src/design/typography.css — font stacks + scale + line-heights\n   185→      - id: design-agent.tokens.spacing\n   186→        scope: frontend/src/design/spacing.css — 4px-based spacing scale + radius tokens\n   187→      - id: design-agent.primitives.status-badge\n   188→        scope: frontend/src/components/StatusBadge.tsx — variant prop per agent\n   189→          lifecycle state, identity-color border\n   190→      - id: design-agent.primitives.stat-card\n   191→        scope: frontend/src/components/StatCard.tsx — title + value + delta + sparkline\n   192→          slot\n   193→      - id: design-agent.docs.cheatsheet\n   194→        scope: frontend/src/design/CHEATSHEET.md — token names, usage rules, do/don't\n   195→      - id: design-agent.docs.reference\n   196→        scope: frontend/src/design/REFERENCE.md — full token table + component gallery\n   197→  - id: auth-agent\n   198→    scope: JWT issuance, magic-link flow, Resend integration, get_current_user\n   199→      dependency\n   200→    branch: feat/auth-agent\n   201→    blocked_by:\n   202→      - data-agent\n   203→    blocks:\n   204→      - api-agent\n   205→      - frontend-agent\n   206→      - api-streaming-agent\n   207→    capabilities:\n   208→      - jwt\n   209→      - resend\n   210→      - fastapi-deps\n   211→    sub_agents:\n   212→      - id: auth-agent.magic-link.request\n   213→        scope: backend/api/auth.py POST /auth/magic-link — issue token, send via Resend,\n   214→          rate-limit 3/hour/email\n   215→      - id: auth-agent.magic-link.verify\n   216→        scope: backend/api/auth.py POST /auth/verify — validate token, mint JWT, return\n   217→          session cookie\n   218→      - id: auth-agent.magic-link.resend\n   219→        scope: backend/api/auth.py POST /auth/resend — invalidate prior token, issue new\n   220→      - id: auth-agent.jwt.issue\n   221→        scope: backend/auth/jwt.py issue_jwt(candidate_id, ttl_hours=24) — HS256, signed\n   222→          with settings.jwt_secret\n   223→      - id: auth-agent.jwt.validate\n   224→        scope: backend/auth/jwt.py validate_jwt(token) — raise on expired/invalid\n   225→      - id: auth-agent.jwt.current-user\n   226→        scope: backend/auth/deps.py get_current_user FastAPI dependency — reads cookie\n   227→          or Authorization header, loads Candidate\n   228→  - id: obs-agent\n   229→    scope: \"Observability: structlog config, PII redaction, Redis pub/sub taxonomy,\n   230→      CRM events, health endpoint\"\n   231→    branch: feat/obs-agent\n   232→    blocked_by:\n   233→      - data-agent\n   234→    blocks:\n   235→      - api-agent\n   236→      - discover-agent\n   237→      - apply-agent\n   238→      - api-streaming-agent\n   239→    capabilities:\n   240→